{"text": "Nearly all the stalls were closed, and the greater part of the hall was in darkness, and I recognised a silence like that which pervades a church after a service. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the door of one stall, a young lady was talking and laughing with two young gentlemen, and I noticed their English accents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> O, I never said such a thing, she said, and their silly, flirting talk went on as if I were not there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Observing me, the young lady came over and asked me whether I wished to buy anything, but her tone was not encouraging. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> No, thank you, I said, and I stood there for a while, pretending to be interested in her wares, knowing that my staying was useless. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I heard a voice at one end of the gallery calling that the light was out, and the upper part of the hall was now completely dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Gazing up into the darkness, I saw myself as a creature driven and derided by vanity, and my eyes burned with anguish and anger.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "a", "r", "l", "y", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "l", "l", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "l", "l", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", "n", "e", "s", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "I", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "g", "n", "i", "s", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "s", "i", "l", "e", "n", "c", "e", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "p", "e", "r", "v", "a", "d", "e", "s", " ", "a", " ", "c", "h", "u", "r", "c", "h", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "s", "e", "r", "v", "i", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\""